{"seq":1,"slug":"divisibility-and-modular","title":"整除性与模运算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/number-theory/divisibility-and-modular","wordCount":1594,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"整除性与模运算\">整除性与模运算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>整除性和模运算是数论的基石，也是计算机科学中最常用的数学工具之一。整除关系定义了整数之间的&quot;可分性&quot;——a 整除 b（记为 a | b）当且仅当存在整数 k 使得 b = ak。模运算则将整数映射到有限范围内——a mod n 是 a 除以 n 的余数。</p>\n<p>在编程中，模运算无处不在：哈希函数用 h(k) = k mod m 将键映射到桶；循环缓冲区用 (index + 1) mod size 实现循环；密码学中的 RSA 加密完全建立在模幂运算之上。理解模运算的数学性质，是写出正确且高效代码的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[数论基础]&#10;    A --&gt; B[整除性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[模运算]&#10;    B --&gt; D[因子与倍数]&#10;    B --&gt; E[素数]&#10;    B --&gt; F[GCD/LCM]&#10;    C --&gt; G[同余关系]&#10;    C --&gt; H[模算术]&#10;    C --&gt; I[模逆元]&#10;    F --&gt; J[欧几里得算法]&#10;    I --&gt; K[扩展欧几里得]\">graph TB\n    A[数论基础]\n    A --&gt; B[整除性]\n    A --&gt; C[模运算]\n    B --&gt; D[因子与倍数]\n    B --&gt; E[素数]\n    B --&gt; F[GCD/LCM]\n    C --&gt; G[同余关系]\n    C --&gt; H[模算术]\n    C --&gt; I[模逆元]\n    F --&gt; J[欧几里得算法]\n    I --&gt; K[扩展欧几里得]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>表示</th>\n<th>编程对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整除</td>\n<td>a|b ⟺ ∃k: b = ak</td>\n<td>a | b</td>\n<td><code>b % a === 0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余数</td>\n<td>a = qn + r, 0 ≤ r &lt; n</td>\n<td>a mod n = r</td>\n<td><code>a % n</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同余</td>\n<td>a ≡ b (mod n) ⟺ n | (a-b)</td>\n<td>a ≡ b (mod n)</td>\n<td><code>a % n === b % n</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GCD</td>\n<td>最大公因数</td>\n<td>gcd(a,b)</td>\n<td>欧几里得算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCM</td>\n<td>最小公倍数</td>\n<td>lcm(a,b) = ab/gcd(a,b)</td>\n<td>利用 GCD 计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>素数</td>\n<td>只有 1 和自身为因子</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>素性检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最大公因数与欧几里得算法\">最大公因数与欧几里得算法</h2><p><strong>最大公因数</strong> gcd(a, b) 是同时整除 a 和 b 的最大正整数。<strong>最小公倍数</strong> lcm(a, b) 是同时被 a 和 b 整除的最小正整数。两者的关系：gcd(a, b) × lcm(a, b) = a × b。</p>\n<p><strong>欧几里得算法</strong>（辗转相除法）基于性质 gcd(a, b) = gcd(b, a mod b) 递归计算 GCD。时间复杂度 O(log min(a, b))，是最古老且最高效的算法之一（约公元前 300 年）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function gcd(a: number, b: number): number {&#10;  while (b !== 0) {&#10;    [a, b] = [b, a % b];&#10;  }&#10;  return a;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function lcm(a: number, b: number): number {&#10;  return (a / gcd(a, b)) * b;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gcd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [a, b] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [b, a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lcm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gcd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, b)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>欧几里得算法的效率分析表明：最坏情况发生在输入为连续斐波那契数时（如 gcd(Fₙ, Fₙ₋₁)），此时需要约 log_φ(n) 步。这是因为斐波那契数的比值趋近于黄金比例 φ。</p>\n<p><strong>扩展欧几里得算法</strong>不仅计算 gcd(a, b)，还找到整数 x, y 使得 ax + by = gcd(a, b)（Bézout 等式）。这在计算模逆元时至关重要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function extendedGcd(a: number, b: number): { gcd: number; x: number; y: number } {&#10;  if (b === 0) return { gcd: a, x: 1, y: 0 };&#10;  const { gcd: g, x: x1, y: y1 } = extendedGcd(b, a % b);&#10;  return { gcd: g, x: y1, y: x1 - Math.floor(a / b) * y1 };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extendedGcd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gcd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { gcd: a, x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gcd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">x1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">y1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extendedGcd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(b, a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { gcd: g, x: y1, y: x1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y1 };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>GCD 在编程中的常见应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分数化简</strong>：将 a/b 化为最简分数，分子分母同除以 gcd(a, b)</li>\n<li><strong>时间调度</strong>：两个周期为 a 和 b 的事件同时发生的周期为 lcm(a, b)</li>\n<li><strong>数据分片</strong>：将数据均匀分到 gcd(n, m) 组中</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"模算术与同余\">模算术与同余</h2><p><strong>同余关系</strong> a ≡ b (mod n) 表示 a 和 b 除以 n 的余数相同，等价于 n | (a - b)。同余关系是整数上的等价关系（自反、对称、传递），将整数划分为 n 个等价类（余数类）{0, 1, 2, ..., n-1}。</p>\n<p>模算术保持加法和乘法的基本运算律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(a + b) mod n = ((a mod n) + (b mod n)) mod n</li>\n<li>(a × b) mod n = ((a mod n) × (b mod n)) mod n</li>\n<li>(a - b) mod n = ((a mod n) - (b mod n) + n) mod n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些性质使得大数运算可以在中间步骤取模，避免溢出。这在密码学中至关重要——RSA 中的模幂运算 aᵉ mod n 利用反复平方法（Repeated Squaring）在 O(log e) 次乘法内完成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function modPow(base: bigint, exp: bigint, mod: bigint): bigint {&#10;  let result = 1n;&#10;  base = base % mod;&#10;  while (exp &gt; 0n) {&#10;    if (exp % 2n === 1n) {&#10;      result = (result * base) % mod;&#10;    }&#10;    exp = exp / 2n;&#10;    base = (base * base) % mod;&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> modPow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mod;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (exp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (exp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mod;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mod;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：模运算不保持除法。(a / b) mod n ≠ ((a mod n) / (b mod n)) mod n。要在模运算中&quot;除以 b&quot;，需要乘以 b 的<strong>模逆元</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>模逆元</strong>：a 的模 n 逆元是满足 a × a⁻¹ ≡ 1 (mod n) 的整数 a⁻¹。模逆元存在当且仅当 gcd(a, n) = 1。可以通过扩展欧几里得算法计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function modInverse(a: number, n: number): number | null {&#10;  const { gcd: g, x } = extendedGcd(a, n);&#10;  if (g !== 1) return null;&#10;  return ((x % n) + n) % n;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> modInverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gcd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extendedGcd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"素数与素性检测\">素数与素性检测</h2><p><strong>素数</strong>是大于 1 且只有 1 和自身两个因子的正整数。<strong>算术基本定理</strong>说：每个大于 1 的正整数都可以唯一地（不考虑顺序）分解为素数的乘积。这个定理是整个数论的基石。</p>\n<p><strong>素数的分布</strong>：小于 n 的素数个数约为 n/ln(n)（素数定理）。这意味着随机选取的大整数是素数的概率约为 1/ln(n)。对于 1024 位整数，约每 710 个就有一个素数。</p>\n<p><strong>试除法</strong>检测素性：检查 2 到 √n 的所有整数是否整除 n。时间复杂度 O(√n)。</p>\n<p><strong>埃拉托斯特尼筛法</strong>（Sieve of Eratosthenes）找出 2 到 n 的所有素数，时间复杂度 O(n log log n)。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function sieve(n: number): boolean[] {&#10;  const isPrime = new Array(n + 1).fill(true);&#10;  isPrime[0] = isPrime[1] = false;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 2; i * i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    if (isPrime[i]) {&#10;      for (let j = i * i; j &lt;= n; j += i) {&#10;        isPrime[j] = false;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return isPrime;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sieve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isPrime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  isPrime[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isPrime[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isPrime[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        isPrime[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isPrime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>试除法</td>\n<td>O(√n)</td>\n<td>单个数素性检测</td>\n<td>小数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>筛法</td>\n<td>O(n log log n)</td>\n<td>枚举范围内所有素数</td>\n<td>中等范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Miller-Rabin</td>\n<td>O(k log²n)</td>\n<td>概率性素性检测</td>\n<td>大数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AKS</td>\n<td>O(log⁶n)</td>\n<td>确定性素性检测</td>\n<td>理论意义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Miller-Rabin 素性检测</strong>是实际中最常用的大数素性测试算法。它是概率性的——如果判定为合数则一定正确，如果判定为素数则有极小的错误概率（可通过多次测试降低）。密码库中生成 RSA 密钥对时使用的就是 Miller-Rabin。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模运算在工程中的应用\">模运算在工程中的应用</h2><p><strong>哈希函数</strong>：h(k) = k mod m 将键映射到 {0, ..., m-1}。选择 m 为素数可以减少碰撞——因为素数与大多数输入的 pattern 互素，分布更均匀。</p>\n<p><strong>循环缓冲区</strong>：用数组实现固定大小的队列，<code>next = (current + 1) % capacity</code>。这是操作系统、网络缓冲区和音频处理中的基本数据结构。</p>\n<p><strong>校验和与 CRC</strong>：循环冗余校验（CRC）利用多项式的模运算来检测数据传输中的错误。CRC-32 广泛用于网络协议和文件格式（如 ZIP、PNG）。</p>\n<p><strong>RSA 加密</strong>：基于大素数分解的困难性。选择两个大素数 p, q，计算 n = pq。加密 c = mᵉ mod n，解密 m = cᵈ mod n，其中 ed ≡ 1 (mod φ(n))。整个系统建立在模幂运算和模逆元之上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 模运算应用&#10;        A[哈希函数]&#10;        B[循环缓冲区]&#10;        C[校验和 CRC]&#10;        D[RSA 加密]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 核心操作&#10;        E[取模 %]&#10;        F[模幂]&#10;        G[模逆元]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; G\">graph TB\n    subgraph 模运算应用\n        A[哈希函数]\n        B[循环缓冲区]\n        C[校验和 CRC]\n        D[RSA 加密]\n    end\n    subgraph 核心操作\n        E[取模 %]\n        F[模幂]\n        G[模逆元]\n    end\n    A --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((整除性与模运算))&#10;    整除性&#10;      因子与倍数&#10;      GCD/LCM&#10;      欧几里得算法&#10;    模运算&#10;      同余关系&#10;      模算术律&#10;      模逆元&#10;    素数&#10;      算术基本定理&#10;      素数定理&#10;      筛法&#10;      Miller-Rabin&#10;    工程应用&#10;      哈希函数&#10;      循环缓冲区&#10;      CRC 校验&#10;      RSA 加密\">mindmap\n  root((整除性与模运算))\n    整除性\n      因子与倍数\n      GCD/LCM\n      欧几里得算法\n    模运算\n      同余关系\n      模算术律\n      模逆元\n    素数\n      算术基本定理\n      素数定理\n      筛法\n      Miller-Rabin\n    工程应用\n      哈希函数\n      循环缓冲区\n      CRC 校验\n      RSA 加密</pre><ul>\n<li>gcd 和 lcm 是整除性的核心工具，欧几里得算法以 O(log n) 效率计算 GCD</li>\n<li>同余关系是整数上的等价关系，将整数划分为 n 个余数类</li>\n<li>模算术保持加法和乘法，但不保持除法——除法需要模逆元</li>\n<li>模逆元存在当且仅当 gcd(a, n) = 1，可通过扩展欧几里得算法计算</li>\n<li>算术基本定理保证每个整数有唯一的素因数分解</li>\n<li>素数哈希表大小的选择利用了素数与大多数 pattern 互素的性质</li>\n<li>RSA 加密完全建立在模幂运算和大素数分解的困难性之上</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"整除性与模运算","id":"整除性与模运算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"最大公因数与欧几里得算法","id":"最大公因数与欧几里得算法"},{"level":2,"text":"模算术与同余","id":"模算术与同余"},{"level":2,"text":"素数与素性检测","id":"素数与素性检测"},{"level":2,"text":"模运算在工程中的应用","id":"模运算在工程中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图着色与匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/graph-coloring"},"next":{"title":"代数结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/number-theory/algebraic-structures"}}